<title>JAPAN: Output at big Japan aluminium mills rises in Nov.</title>
<headline>Output at big Japan aluminium mills rises in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Output of fabricated aluminium products at Japan's seven leading mills rose 3.1 percent in November from the same month last year to 128,818 tonnes, according to data submitted by the companies to the Japan Aluminum Federation and released on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The November data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     Nov 96	 yr/yr change</p>
<p>   Total	  128,818	  +3.1 pct</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled  100,547	  +1.5 pct</p>
<p>     Can stock   28,983	  -9.9 pct</p>
<p>   Extrusions    28,271	  +9.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
